//	header  8 bytes  "BCLCNM" (6 bytes) + uint16 version
//	count   4 bytes  number of registered consumers
//	entries count × (8-byte confirmed sequence, 2-byte name length,
//	                name bytes)
//	crc32   4 bytes  IEEE checksum of every preceding byte
